cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  accompanying manuscript.
title: >-
  Analysis code for "EBV reactivation priming of the peripheral immune system
  in multiple sclerosis relapse"
abstract: >-
  Figure and analysis code for an observational study of longitudinal blood
  samples from patients with relapsing-remitting multiple sclerosis, combining
  single-cell RNA sequencing, bulk transcriptomics, multiparameter flow
  cytometry and targeted viral RT-qPCR to construct a time-resolved atlas of
  immune perturbations surrounding relapse.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "TBD before publication"
keywords:
  - multiple sclerosis
  - Epstein-Barr virus
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - B cells
  - flow cytometry
